{"id":"633016","name":"烫面油饼","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/633016/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"高筋粉","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"小苏打","amount":"3g"},{"name":"油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"高筋粉、小苏打、盐加入热水（不烫手）和成面团。","img":"images/633016/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"分三等份。","img":"images/633016/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"刷玉米油。","img":"images/633016/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"擀成薄饼再刷一层油。","img":"images/633016/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"从圆心切一条半径。","img":"images/633016/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"如图卷起。","img":"images/633016/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"卷成冰激凌形状。","img":"images/633016/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把冰淇淋小头冲下。","img":"images/633016/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"从上端向下压扁。","img":"images/633016/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再次擀薄。","img":"images/633016/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"锅热倒油下面饼。","img":"images/633016/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"翻面刷油。","img":"images/633016/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"两面金黄即可。","img":"images/633016/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"切块，装盘！","img":"images/633016/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"一起吃饼吧！","img":"images/633016/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"和面的水稍微热一些。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}